#: src/title-page.md:1
msgid "The Rust Programming Language"
msgstr "Rust 程式設計語言"

#: src/title-page.md:3
msgid ""
"_by Steve Klabnik, Carol Nichols, and Chris Krycho, with contributions from "
"the Rust Community_"
msgstr ""
"_由 Steve Klabnik、Carol Nichols 與 Chris Krycho，以及 Rust 社群的貢獻撰寫而"
"成_"

#: src/title-page.md:6
msgid ""
"This version of the text assumes you’re using Rust 1.90.0 (released "
"2025-09-18) or later with `edition = \"2024\"` in the _Cargo.toml_ file of "
"all projects to configure them to use Rust 2024 Edition idioms. See the "
"[“Installation” section of Chapter 1](ch01-01-installation.html)<!-- ignore "
"--> for instructions on installing or updating Rust, and see [Appendix E]"
"(appendix-05-editions.html)<!-- ignore --> for information on editions."
msgstr ""
"本文此版本假設你使用 Rust 1.90.0（發佈於 2025-09-18）或更新版本，並在所有專案"
"的 _Cargo.toml_ 檔案中設定 `edition = \"2024\"`，以使用 Rust 2024 版次的慣用"
"法。安裝或更新 Rust 的說明請見[第 1 章的「安裝」](ch01-01-installation."
"html)<!-- ignore -->，關於版次的資訊請見[附錄 E](appendix-05-editions."
"html)<!-- ignore -->。"

#: src/title-page.md:13
msgid ""
"The HTML format is available online at [https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/"
"book/](https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/book/) and offline with "
"installations of Rust made with `rustup`; run `rustup doc --book` to open."
msgstr ""
"HTML 版可在 [https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/book/](https://doc.rust-lang."
"org/stable/book/) 線上閱讀，也可在以 `rustup` 安裝 Rust 後離線閱讀；執行 "
"`rustup doc --book` 即可開啟。"

#: src/title-page.md:18
msgid ""
"Several community [translations](appendix-06-translation.html) are also "
"available."
msgstr "也提供多種社群[翻譯](appendix-06-translation.html)。"

#: src/title-page.md:20
msgid ""
"This text is available in [paperback and ebook format from No Starch Press]"
"(https://nostarch.com/rust-programming-language-3rd-edition)."
msgstr ""
"本書亦由 [No Starch Press 提供平裝與電子書版本](https://nostarch.com/rust-"
"programming-language-3rd-edition)。"

#: src/title-page.md:28
msgid ""
"**🚨 Want a more interactive learning experience? Try out a different "
"version of the Rust Book, featuring: quizzes, highlighting, visualizations, "
"and more**: <https://rust-book.cs.brown.edu>"
msgstr ""
"**🚨 想要更具互動性的學習體驗？試試看另一個版本的 Rust Book，包含：小測驗、標"
"註、視覺化等功能**：<https://rust-book.cs.brown.edu>"
